<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Poongsan Corp H1 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Poongsan Corp H1 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				     355 vs 272</p>
<p>    Net					    6.83 vs 5.22</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			  8.53 vs 8.48</p>
<p>    Turnover				   357.79 vs 387.93</p>
<p>Note - Poongsan Corp is South Korea's leading producer of copper products, including copper pipes and copper bars. The figures were provided by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5645</p>
</text>
